<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef steady to firm on mostlymoderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice chuck, round and loin cuts steady to firm, while rib cuts generally steady. Beef trimmings generally steady on light to moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
